    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051122.0128\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 22 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nChinese FM has phone coversation with Syrian counterpart\n\n\n\n\nChinese Foreign Minister Li Zhaoxing had a telephone conversation with his Syrian counterpart Faruk al-Shareh Tuesday night, according to the Chinese Foreign Ministry.\n\nThe two exchanged views on regional issues, said a ministry press release without giving any details.",
